.nh
.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-completion - Generate a shell completion script


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro completion bash|zsh|fish|powershell [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Load completions:
  bash:  source <(gyro completion bash)        # or: gyro completion bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/gyro
  zsh:   gyro completion zsh > "${fpath[1]}/_gyro"
  fish:  gyro completion fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/gyro.fish
  pwsh:  gyro completion powershell | Out-String | Invoke-Expression
Server, SSH key and other ids complete from the API.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for completion


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro(1)\fP
